  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Implementation Details**\n\nOkay, so I\'ve confirmed the applet builds flawlessly! Now, I am meticulously reviewing the finalized feature list to confirm full adherence to the user\'s requirements. Specifically, I\'ve checked the \"one question at a time\" constraint, handled with the `currentIdx` variable and dynamic rendering, as well as the elegant styling of clickable answer choices achieved using interactive elements.\n\n\n**Confirming UI Enhancements**\n\nI\'ve just finished verifying all the UI enhancements and they are looking excellent. The save functionality uses `localStorage` for seamless navigation. Navigation buttons, hotkeys, and progress indicators are all in place. A question navigator panel dynamically updates, offering a clear view. The submit button is ready, along with the score calculation and response highlighting post-submission.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully converted the exam questions into a fully functional, premium, single-page **SPDI Set A Reviewer** application.\n\nHere is a summary of the accomplishments and the design choices:\n\n- **Elegant Vanilla Architecture**: Built entirely with highly performant HTML5, vanilla JavaScript, and modern responsive Tailwind CSS.\n- **Dynamic Quiz Engine**:\n  - **Single Question Focus**: Displays only one question at a time with clean, readable typography.\n  - **Interactive Clickable Answers**: Choices are fully styled with custom borders, lettered prefixes (A, B, C, D), and active hover/selection states.\n  - **Sleek Question Navigator**: Includes a sidebar grid showing all 76 questions. Elements are color-coded (unanswered, answered, correct, and incorrect) and support direct jumping.\n  - **Persistent Local Progress**: Automatically saves your current question index, chosen answers, configurations, and dark mode state to `localStorage`.\n- **Intelligent Study Modes**:\n  - **Shuffle Questions & Choices**: Toggles are available in the sidebar to randomize the question sequence or choice positions to test genuine mastery.\n  - **Review Incorrect Answers**: An interactive targeted study mode that temporarily filters your active question pool to let you focus solely on questions answered incorrectly.\n- **Submission & Detailed Feedback**:\n  - **Interactive Results Modal**: Displays your final score with a beautiful, custom-animated circular SVG progress ring, final percentage, and passing status (70% threshold).\n  - **Real-Time Corrections**: After submitting, correct answers are highlighted in **green** with a check icon, and incorrect selections in **red** with an \"x\" icon, complete with contextual correction text blocks.\n- **User Experience Touches**:\n  - **Desktop Keyboard Controls**: Seamlessly navigate the exam with `\342\206\220` (Previous), `\342\206\222` (Next), and `1`\342\200\223`4` keys to select choices.\n  - **High-Contrast Dark Mode**: A modern, eyes-safe slate-and-indigo dark theme toggle is available in the header.\n  - **Search & Filter**: Allows you to instantly search question text and highlight matches on the navigator board.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 361344829
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
