  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Professional Polish\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Professional Polish\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\\\"app-root\\\" style=\\\"height: 768px; width: 1024px; background-color: #f8fafc; font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden;\\\"> <style> :root { --primary: #2563eb; --primary-hover: #1d4ed8; --bg-main: #f8fafc; --bg-card: #ffffff; --text-main: #1e293b; --text-muted: #64748b; --border: #e2e8f0; --success: #22c55e; --danger: #ef4444; } .dark-mode { --bg-main: #0f172a; --bg-card: #1e293b; --text-main: #f1f5f9; --text-muted: #94a3b8; --border: #334155; } .app-root { color: var(--text-main); } .sidebar { width: 280px; border-right: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-card); display: flex; flex-direction: column; } .main-content { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 40px; background: var(--bg-main); } .header { height: 64px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-card); } .nav-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 8px; padding: 20px; overflow-y: auto; } .nav-btn { height: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; background: var(--bg-card); cursor: pointer; } .nav-btn.answered { background: #dbeafe; border-color: #2563eb; color: #2563eb; } .nav-btn.active { background: #2563eb; border-color: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; } .question-card { background: var(--bg-card); border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; } .choice { display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 16px; border: 2px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 500; } .choice:hover { border-color: var(--primary); background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.05); } .choice.selected { border-color: var(--primary); background: #eff6ff; } .btn { padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; border: none; font-size: 14px; } .btn-primary { background: var(--primary); color: white; } .btn-secondary { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text-main); } .progress-bar-container { height: 8px; background: var(--border); border-radius: 4px; flex: 1; margin: 0 20px; position: relative; } .progress-fill { height: 100%; background: var(--primary); border-radius: 4px; width: 45%; } .keyboard-hint { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-top: 12px; } .key-cap { background: var(--border); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; color: var(--text-main); font-weight: bold; } </style> <header class=\\\"header\\\"> <div style=\\\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;\\\"> <div style=\\\"width: 32px; height: 32px; background: var(--primary); border-radius: 6px; display: grid; place-items: center; color: white; font-weight: bold;\\\">E</div> <h1 style=\\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\\\">Cloud Architect Pro Certification</h1> </div> <div style=\\\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; flex: 0 0 400px;\\\"> <span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 500;\\\">Question 24 of 50</span> <div class=\\\"progress-bar-container\\\"><div class=\\\"progress-fill\\\"></div></div> <div style=\\\"display: flex; gap: 8px;\\\"> <div style=\\\"padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--border); cursor: pointer;\\\"> <svg width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"><circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"10\\\"/><path d=\\\"M12 2v20M2 12h20\\\"/></svg> </div> </div> </div> </header> <div style=\\\"display: flex; flex: 1; overflow: hidden;\\\"> <aside class=\\\"sidebar\\\"> <div style=\\\"padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\\\"> <h3 style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0;\\\">Exam Navigator</h3> <p style=\\\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 4px;\\\">22 answered, 28 remaining</p> </div> <div class=\\\"nav-grid\\\"> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">1</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">2</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">3</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">4</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">5</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">6</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">7</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">8</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">9</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">10</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">11</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">12</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">13</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">14</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">15</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">16</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">17</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">18</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">19</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">20</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">21</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">22</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">23</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn active\\\">24</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn\\\">25</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn\\\">26</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn\\\">27</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn\\\">28</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn\\\">29</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn\\\">30</div> </div> <div style=\\\"margin-top: auto; padding: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\\\"> <button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" style=\\\"width: 100%; background: #059669;\\\">Submit Examination</button> </div> </aside> <main class=\\\"main-content\\\"> <div class=\\\"question-card\\\"> <div style=\\\"margin-bottom: 32px;\\\"> <span style=\\\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;\\\">Domain 3: High Availability</span> <h2 style=\\\"font-size: 24px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\\\">A company requires a multi-tier application to be highly available across multiple regions with a Recovery Time Objective (RTO) of less than 5 minutes. Which database configuration should be implemented?</h2> </div> <div style=\\\"flex: 1;\\\"> <div class=\\\"choice selected\\\"> <div style=\\\"width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--primary); margin-right: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\\\"> <div style=\\\"width: 12px; height: 12px; background: var(--primary); border-radius: 50%;\\\"></div> </div> <span>A. Global Database with asynchronous replication and automated cross-region failover.</span> </div> <div class=\\\"choice\\\"> <div style=\\\"width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--border); margin-right: 16px;\\\"></div> <span>B. Multi-AZ deployment with daily cross-region snapshots and manual restore process.</span> </div> <div class=\\\"choice\\\"> <div style=\\\"width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--border); margin-right: 16px;\\\"></div> <span>C. Single-region deployment with high-frequency log shipping to a secondary region.</span> </div> <div class=\\\"choice\\\"> <div style=\\\"width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--border); margin-right: 16px;\\\"></div> <span>D. Read Replicas in each region with a Global Load Balancer pointing to the primary.</span> </div> </div> <div style=\\\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\\\"> <div style=\\\"display: flex; gap: 12px;\\\"> <button class=\\\"btn btn-secondary\\\">Previous</button> <button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\">Next Question</button> </div> <div class=\\\"keyboard-hint\\\"> <span><span class=\\\"key-cap\\\">\342\206\220</span> Previous</span> <span><span class=\\\"key-cap\\\">\342\206\222</span> Next</span> <span><span class=\\\"key-cap\\\">1</span>-<span class=\\\"key-cap\\\">4</span> Select Answer</span> </div> </div> </div> </main> </div> </div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Professional Polish\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Professional Polish\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\\\"app-root\\\" style=\\\"height: 768px; width: 1024px; background-color: #f8fafc; font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden;\\\"> <style> :root { --primary: #2563eb; --primary-hover: #1d4ed8; --bg-main: #f8fafc; --bg-card: #ffffff; --text-main: #1e293b; --text-muted: #64748b; --border: #e2e8f0; --success: #22c55e; --danger: #ef4444; } .dark-mode { --bg-main: #0f172a; --bg-card: #1e293b; --text-main: #f1f5f9; --text-muted: #94a3b8; --border: #334155; } .app-root { color: var(--text-main); } .sidebar { width: 280px; border-right: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-card); display: flex; flex-direction: column; } .main-content { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 40px; background: var(--bg-main); } .header { height: 64px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg-card); } .nav-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 8px; padding: 20px; overflow-y: auto; } .nav-btn { height: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; background: var(--bg-card); cursor: pointer; } .nav-btn.answered { background: #dbeafe; border-color: #2563eb; color: #2563eb; } .nav-btn.active { background: #2563eb; border-color: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; } .question-card { background: var(--bg-card); border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; } .choice { display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 16px; border: 2px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 500; } .choice:hover { border-color: var(--primary); background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.05); } .choice.selected { border-color: var(--primary); background: #eff6ff; } .btn { padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; border: none; font-size: 14px; } .btn-primary { background: var(--primary); color: white; } .btn-secondary { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text-main); } .progress-bar-container { height: 8px; background: var(--border); border-radius: 4px; flex: 1; margin: 0 20px; position: relative; } .progress-fill { height: 100%; background: var(--primary); border-radius: 4px; width: 45%; } .keyboard-hint { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-top: 12px; } .key-cap { background: var(--border); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; color: var(--text-main); font-weight: bold; } </style> <header class=\\\"header\\\"> <div style=\\\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;\\\"> <div style=\\\"width: 32px; height: 32px; background: var(--primary); border-radius: 6px; display: grid; place-items: center; color: white; font-weight: bold;\\\">E</div> <h1 style=\\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\\\">Cloud Architect Pro Certification</h1> </div> <div style=\\\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; flex: 0 0 400px;\\\"> <span style=\\\"font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 500;\\\">Question 24 of 50</span> <div class=\\\"progress-bar-container\\\"><div class=\\\"progress-fill\\\"></div></div> <div style=\\\"display: flex; gap: 8px;\\\"> <div style=\\\"padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--border); cursor: pointer;\\\"> <svg width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"><circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"10\\\"/><path d=\\\"M12 2v20M2 12h20\\\"/></svg> </div> </div> </div> </header> <div style=\\\"display: flex; flex: 1; overflow: hidden;\\\"> <aside class=\\\"sidebar\\\"> <div style=\\\"padding: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\\\"> <h3 style=\\\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0;\\\">Exam Navigator</h3> <p style=\\\"font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 4px;\\\">22 answered, 28 remaining</p> </div> <div class=\\\"nav-grid\\\"> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">1</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">2</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">3</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">4</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">5</div> <div class=\\\"nav-btn answered\\\">6</