 flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\\\"> <div style=\\\"width: 12px; height: 12px; background: var(--primary); border-radius: 50%;\\\"></div> </div> <span>A. Global Database with asynchronous replication and automated cross-region failover.</span> </div> <div class=\\\"choice\\\"> <div style=\\\"width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--border); margin-right: 16px;\\\"></div> <span>B. Multi-AZ deployment with daily cross-region snapshots and manual restore process.</span> </div> <div class=\\\"choice\\\"> <div style=\\\"width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--border); margin-right: 16px;\\\"></div> <span>C. Single-region deployment with high-frequency log shipping to a secondary region.</span> </div> <div class=\\\"choice\\\"> <div style=\\\"width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--border); margin-right: 16px;\\\"></div> <span>D. Read Replicas in each region with a Global Load Balancer pointing to the primary.</span> </div> </div> <div style=\\\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\\\"> <div style=\\\"display: flex; gap: 12px;\\\"> <button class=\\\"btn btn-secondary\\\">Previous</button> <button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\">Next Question</button> </div> <div class=\\\"keyboard-hint\\\"> <span><span class=\\\"key-cap\\\">\342\206\220</span> Previous</span> <span><span class=\\\"key-cap\\\">\342\206\222</span> Next</span> <span><span class=\\\"key-cap\\\">1</span>-<span class=\\\"key-cap\\\">4</span> Select Answer</span> </div> </div> </div> </main> </div> </div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
