    thinking: "**Confirming Compilation & Layout**\n\nI\'m thrilled; the linter and compiler both completed without a hitch! Now, I\'m shifting my focus to meticulously reviewing the layout and associated files to ensure a comprehensive, error-free final structure. Let\'s see if anything else needs to be refined.\n\n\n**Refining Styling Implementation**\n\nI\'ve just added the \"Professional Polish\" design theme, extracting styling and layout patterns from the Design HTML. The color scheme is now Royal/Indigo Blue. All cards are formatted with rounded corners and double-pixel borders. I\'ve also restyled choice buttons with custom circular option badges. The next steps involve ensuring a seamless integration, focusing on visual flow and user experience.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully completed the full application of the **Professional Polish** design theme, aligning all UI styling, color palettes, spacing, borders, shadows, and interactive layouts with a high-end, premium aesthetic:\n\n### \360\237\216\250 Visual & Aesthetic Accomplishments\n* **Premium Royal Blue Palette**: Integrated the theme\'s core primary `--primary: #2563eb` color across the application. Replaced the default colors with royal blue highlights, on-theme toggle buttons, and responsive active states.\n* **Refined Surfaces & Borders**: Restructured all card container borders to use high-contrast dual-pixel slate styles (`border-2`) and responsive light-mode/dark-mode surfaces (`bg-white` / `bg-[#f8fafc]` in light mode, and `bg-[#1e293b]` / `bg-[#0f172a]` in dark mode).\n* **Elegant Circular Radios for Choices**: Transformed the choice prefix letter badges into beautiful, fully responsive circular buttons that act as custom radio indicators, changing seamlessly from sleek neutral rings into primary-colored active pills.\n* **Color-coded feedback & Navigator Indicators**: Restyled the navigator grid items to follow the professional spec. Selected/Answered answers use subtle brand washes (`bg-[#dbeafe]`), while post-submit reviews display clean success/danger colors.\n* **Retained Absolute Structural Integrity**: Preserved 100% of the underlying features, including targeted wrong-answer study filters, question/choice randomized shuffling, full keyboard shortcuts, local storage persistence, responsive sidebar, and dynamic progress trackers."
