    user_response: "Create a \'Start Exam\' screen for the reviewer application. This screen should display the total number of questions and the exam duration. It should have a prominent \'Start Exam\' button that, when clicked, hides the start screen and begins the exam. Also, implement a way to clear localStorage and restart the exam from the beginning on this screen.\n\nAdd a countdown timer to the exam application. The timer should start when the exam begins and stop when the user submits their answers or the time runs out. Display the remaining time prominently on the screen. If time runs out, automatically submit the exam and show the results. The user can set the timer on their own before the exam starts."
    items {
      text: "Create a \'Start Exam\' screen for the reviewer application. This screen should display the total number of questions and the exam duration. It should have a prominent \'Start Exam\' button that, when clicked, hides the start screen and begins the exam. Also, implement a way to clear localStorage and restart the exam from the beginning on this screen.\n\nAdd a countdown timer to the exam application. The timer should start when the exam begins and stop when the user submits their answers or the time runs out. Display the remaining time prominently on the screen. If time runs out, automatically submit the exam and show the results. The user can set the timer on their own before the exam starts."
    }
  }
}
