    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG46yaxDkEkK23BDt1NMGeAL90GeuJEM5RsUxsThJlZDwfprBu5yLxWk4CzuTHFH8h03Pc1cWPHyh3vtU7Feo1cZh21OsslPoNRe8I7lJrUqbBbC3Q1AAmyWCOggmUrXuXhsEngoJU="
      title: "youtube.com"
    }
    summary: "\"Master\'s Mastery Test: SPDI Set A\" refers to a set of review questions for aspiring Master Plumbers, specifically covering the subject of Sanitation Plumbing Design and Installation (SPDI). This test material is part of a broader resource known as \"Master\'s Mastery,\" which is described as a comprehensive plumbing visual dictionary and review companion[1].\n\nThe \"Master\'s Mastery\" book is designed to help individuals prepare for the Master Plumber Licensure Exam, offering a visual dictionary, illustrated sections of the Plumbing Code, simplified tables, mnemonics, ideograms, and a compilation of numerical values from the Plumbing Code[1]. It also provides exclusive access to integrated learning resources through QR codes, including explainer videos and mastery tests[1]. These online contents are regularly updated to reflect relevant topics and exam trends[1].\n\n\"SPDI: Set A\" appears to be broken down into multiple parts, such as \"SPDI: Set A Part 1\" and \"SPDI: Set A Part 5,\" which contain quiz questions related to various plumbing concepts. These include topics like absorption trenches, trap sizes for different fixtures, plumbing system components, ratios for water closets, types of vents, and materials used in plumbing installations[2][3]. Some questions also cover aspects like pipe color coding, and flushing mechanisms[2][3][4].\n\nThe \"Master Plumber Academy\" offers these SPDI quiz sets, providing immediate feedback on whether a user has passed or failed, and allowing access to all quizzes and materials[2][3]. These materials are intended to bridge the gap with traditional review resources and centers[1]. A YouTube series titled \"SANITATION PLUMBING DESIGN AND INSTALLATION (SPDI) REFRESHER SERIES - MASTER PLUMBER REVIEW\" further provides a comprehensive review for the Master Plumber Licensure Exam, delving into key concepts in plumbing design and estimating techniques[4].\n\nSources:\n[1] [mastersmastery.store](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYC3pZu--Al_RIorGHK8qwxL2ngO-m5RZb_LpcJQjvuLhlx3_U6fSOYY4ue52rTc0XTI1U1fdXlRdt1Agsly153eeeKd8xeQ8LjjZuJY75zmOA85CG77NI)\n[2] [masterplumberacademy.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEuI7zh8mbF9lBsjRCka7LS-bbAIcLOhti6lFHS0R0u-YGzuizua8feT605ycJGpMkb0j7N0rDjW-1PvbmgDOCT5VI3KF7XDk4bowQiWpQO4eTerA2CDdshS_jMLoKsugyY0qz3xzus0LuK7G0hqIEKdxCK)\n[3] [masterplumberacademy.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHhBEJnZHltnpxBkiWb9jkg8IfawsgafochlKWl8HsYwmb7UEVGy3oNisgpbUM85m9qDrPMBPjGLLW9EDOYokau8W88RvNlTb7Qbg62VdsCThqkHt5wCIHlMWZIURLpplfxAMdAuSxqhfCOoF7wyMi8sIVm)\n[4] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG46yaxDkEkK23BDt1NMGeAL90GeuJEM5RsUxsThJlZDwfprBu5yLxWk4CzuTHFH8h03Pc1cWPHyh3vtU7Feo1cZh21OsslPoNRe8I7lJrUqbBbC3Q1AAmyWCOggmUrXuXhsEngoJU=)"
