    summary: "The terms \"Master\'s Mastery,\" \"SPDI,\" and \"Set A\" are most directly connected within the context of preparing for a Master Plumber Board Exam.\n\n**Master\'s Mastery** refers to a comprehensive review companion book designed for aspiring Master Plumbers. This resource includes a visual dictionary, supplemental materials, and integrated learning tools to help with the exam. It specifically covers Plumbing Code, **SPDI**, and Practical Problems[1].\n\n**SPDI** in this context stands for \"Sanitation, Plumbing Design and Installation.\" It is a key subject area covered in the \"Master\'s Mastery\" book and is a component of the Master Plumber Board Exam[1][2][3][4][5].\n\n**Set A** refers to specific sets of practice questions or modules related to the Sanitation, Plumbing Design and Installation (SPDI) section of the Master Plumber exam[2][3][4][5].\n\nBeyond this specific connection, the individual terms also have other meanings:\n\n*   **Mastery** generally signifies comprehensive knowledge or exceptional skill in a particular subject or accomplishment[6][7].\n*   **SPDI** can also refer to:\n    *   **Special Purpose Depository Institutions**: Wyoming-chartered banks that specialize in custody, asset servicing, and fiduciary asset management, often for digital assets[8].\n    *   **SPDI data model**: Used in bioinformatics by the NCBI to define genetic variants with attributes like sequence, position, deletion, and insertion[9].\n    *   **Strategic Project Delivery Institute**: An organization focused on improving infrastructure project delivery through collaboration and training[10].\n    *   **Sensitive Personal Data and Information**: A legal term under India\'s Information Technology Rules[11].\n*   **Set A** can also refer to:\n    *   **SET A: Corporate and Economic Laws**: Self-paced online modules offered by the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI)[12].\n    *   **SET Active**: A brand that sells activewear, including bras, leggings, and shorts[13][14][15][16].\n\nSources:\n[1] [mastersmastery.store](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG2bAKdjQkPBkjj3L8qMZboXH-gt24x2LPFN8Mk_61fsavds01o-YBsKrYsNGux03cMzKpLRBW_hiuZIr4vmJrR71-8qxkzqqdNe95qvjevB_EdVKRxDA-Y)\n[2] [masterplumberacademy.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGX7FfWYjQTDsSd9pl0oaymyfO3ekW_sCBGyxS2f0LA56a9UXhfF7lZOSvJEj1AMth5U_zkU0NT2QQNdRMAgL-1mhxO-cSWqSiqmSHxhOtAZrmBhRkaJ40bRDh51DBQKcOP0KKdPlRcOFflNWNFpmbdwyaO)\n[3] [masterplumberacademy.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF_k0BX5oauFCEJuKi0BNf6ieSnbY5deRWq8rPtfsVylu0OUrQpHg4lGvOyoue29xN21WQqxBQWH23OQLMrI61eEewvgzrS5Rh_3BTrRs3OybdRT4izY39CwitL-tIiFxlIzfpV7tNjdtOJrlr7SaWhKZxM)\n[4] [masterplumberacademy.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHYcMklUBl8_o94Uk2wKArWCyQ3vVTGk2GfER9wJ4p6DMOQMEMgzGGGnDn-oaTBGniuHkqknzQu6r1O-C0GAsC8lXqNgKq285eXVyknEpSXg8YSFYkDtlRvGqTNeCKXGKw2yckzAPSTr9mE3hCRf-VRJ960)\n[5] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGAV1ZMj0PIYZADrQZcIYp464vQzjxfSJOeI5fXZWDSc-WF7Zd42CqREiBzskkeLzvQNQX4BaXSTluc-cAYFLQ89e61OHg3D2FyWT7mIb-kiUxfwIbjB6soumS2fd8Y5ZbNSbIwfUI=)\n[6] [medium.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFJds58QcKYYfN3muPonSSIXYCqStH8IsT4HTP57KaFID2PR2LBD2s128oQ2YG3MDTV14HK25EX37PiEh7JtHFRf2QW-M2aML-Uy1SBRCTJd2VfnxZt97Ok8efLGojs5NIFidsWrLskpJekVith_dVAhkr5ANJnN_E=)\n[7] [vocabulary.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHPo4cmsyUkeu4HBOldJ40LKYWExSPeT4ish8lcfxktrUozhwMpzidqfEp8mIWN9Axqeq-QYzb2IxtXZhYmj8Tjel6h4PdgV-wnR5JhYwfWCBO5VhNcQBQGkOiZlcLqjHStTdR47rpVaQ==)\n[8] [wyo.gov](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEEj-eK_RwfrIMb_C0K5Qh1-NGZY6I8XM60q8mKXOcHc8QG7iaHx_bGtOlPi6822WiRpzSCXjm16Yuf13PjTDN-4-qMAPOFFzYgFskhqKvoCezcgRLosJy_SvgNwJOBHwleAiLDlgrsZ6C45f9CFQGM2_Y3c63yMAh