    summary: "You are looking for practice questions or exam materials related to \"SPDI\" (Sanitation, Plumbing Design, and Installation) for a Master Plumber certification, specifically inquiring about \"Set A\" questions. Several resources are available that offer practice tests, sample questions, and exam insights for Master Plumber licensure, often with a focus on SPDI.\n\nYou can find the following types of materials:\n*   **Pre-Board and Sample Exams** Documents such as \"SPDI Pre-Board Plumbing Practice Test\" and \"Master Plumber Exam Sample Questions (SPDI-Feb-2023-Final-Mock-Questionaire)\" provide multiple-choice questions covering various plumbing concepts and regulations, including pipe connections, drainage systems, water supply, and plumbing fixtures[1][2].\n*   **\"Set A\" Questions** Specific practice sets like \"SPDI: Set A Part 1\" and \"Master Plumber Exam Practice Set A\" are available, which include questions on topics such as absorption trenches, fixture trap sizes, plumbing system components, and water closet ratios[3][4]. Another resource provides \"Master Plumber Board Exam Questions: Practical Problems Set 1-a\" with questions on pipe sizing, drainage, fixture installation, and material properties[5].\n*   **Readiness Tests and Exam Insights** \"MPLE Readiness Test: SPDI\" and \"SPDI Master Plumber Exam Insights (SPDI Recent and Similar Board Questions MPLE 2022)\" offer readiness tests and discussions of recent board questions, covering topics like water main installation, trap sizes, and plumbing codes[6][7].\n*   **Video Reviews** YouTube channels provide refresher series and question-and-answer sessions focusing on Sanitation, Plumbing Design, and Installation (SPDI) for Master Plumber review[8][9].\n*   **Comprehensive Practice Materials** Some platforms offer practice tests with a significant number of questions designed to simulate the actual exam experience, covering national test objectives[10].\n\nThese resources typically include questions on sanitation, plumbing design, installation, plumbing arithmetic, and relevant codes[2][6][11][4].\n\nSources:\n[1] [scribd.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHdxoy0U2qjfPnKjxIZ5B-NN7VC6H_9zZh1ftGrUgC1La81_YiGsCrpCX2dj8q4I50mC6mLkC9b0U6DIf_pETFFc9E7mM2WXezJUDJq_vzHuaYUqw3lbR-w-6nUPJSDIadEHdGP08WWmkFn-bdcBvFto5w=)\n[2] [scribd.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGKEKLGKhMdfDyb2u1aHMYaiKZkcIntdfbxrsiRqK-q736xhkRW1UrCgrn22iFZdv5_BxU40geXyqGH1dLZB4VCOWTeTE9ZQReawU78cHclEH4uM4I416YDfm52ckuCL9xnJfktFHo6qz8SlsMgYZRRSlr53QrGkRSuS1FJmiCmnv6piN6mvReKlE4=)\n[3] [masterplumberacademy.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEQIGUi0Wx-o66DluviJr7bXhz_-a87viu0uhuRBwleF9hel0EIdh0vgJ6J0AEyO-A_bK-4A7u2i04psYjdY9Hh9fFECknDgOkiwfk5wg10iyrU-BITACaPVImmZuFK5hWHi1IO9v4AxshQTUteFShAfpBH)\n[4] [scribd.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHaDPJL9DuGsdBJW3fiQzPiHT0fYH31gysXAlVnjFfHLuRjdF_o7u3v2DbHV3Q4_2QE9FVfsFcyAugcX48aeP-8kDlNcWUYH4MNL0nkw1Ae7OAf58UZCkjac7B_AnASCVWozWueIHKto58rnwvJz-5aGuK24OnUPM-Zh8V6CR06VLnUWBjSXyE=)\n[5] [docsity.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHbQOJWnQw_9QrpCqQ27Jrrdbw1Dd7lPCxSsKAys2QEJ6J1Ut36PH4HKwvY7Ea8u6-Oz5erSDTA0xP5X7Sgp2SQs7vcYCjbYOC-c2XBRkgTOQ47Aw7TLmeZ_Lfw10IhC_4aLP2A8BNcnY6SNfuc9bllmJzHMBBYHRmnLrw0FrpZsj3p7OdGKmLIQDXQKwS7hxPh6RefJ8xb0EM71tlJqWLtzxoq)\n[6] [masterplumberacademy.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGRWLF6Xt5kL93mQCDpyktoOwaK22LlVAZSD2BgaUGOL2jCKwzDLQV1mDiUEka3cmEeYhWIl8s92lEN46m3WR-pi2QGv93MG9St-GXbLzq2Y3scbGb_yNwmXO_7kO_VQc7J-4yv4x7FacG8SSLSkm3829z-il2in3FyKncQen8eEheWq0oLrKMayg==)\n[7] [scribd.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHuEqFv7R93TG8yxYLKHOeTAp9863um2KZ4AHRmj2WMOwkZ-Wr3UO3AIT8F8xk3s8Pf5psz-fXX2-33dVVRwfCbT7B4ch_hyCl3FwK9Rwb8dGlzB8Rp_a7gh0IxtdMMN5Nz8MB7R-B2FzOHie-