    summary: "The \"Master\'s Mastery Test\" appears to be closely related to the Master Plumber licensure examination, serving as a review tool and resource for individuals aspiring to become Master Plumbers. This test, and associated study materials, often cover key topics including \"SPDI\" and general \"Plumbing\" principles.[1]\n\nSPDI stands for \"Sanitation, Plumbing Design and Installation.\"[2][3] It is a significant subject area within the Master Plumber board examination, encompassing various aspects of plumbing codes, design skills, calculations, and industry standards.[3][4][5][6][7]\n\nResources like the \"Master\'s Mastery Second Edition\" book are designed to assist aspiring Master Plumbers by providing a visual dictionary, illustrated sections of plumbing codes, simplified tables, and access to online content such as explainer videos and mastery tests.[1] These materials are intended to complement traditional review methods and prepare candidates for the comprehensive nature of the Master Plumber exam.[1][8]\n\nThe Master Plumber exam itself is a high-level licensing examination that assesses a plumber\'s knowledge and ability to design plumbing systems, manage projects, supervise other plumbers, and take legal responsibility for installations.[9] It typically covers topics such as the installation of plumbing systems, international plumbing codes (IPC) or uniform plumbing codes (UPC), water supply, drainage systems, vent systems, and fire suppression systems.[10][9] Passing scores generally range from 70% to 75%, varying by state.[9] Numerous practice tests and study guides are available to help candidates prepare for this challenging examination, often incorporating questions related to SPDI.[10][11][12][13][3][4][5][6][8][7][14][15]\n\nSources:\n[1] [mastersmastery.store](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFPolH64rbSxgFt01Pt4G_ovYtX7IHGCJwJhFijckGZB8tg-wEilMlTuDkiJj3ve9JJct5PbLXCElVceM4z7w1Ijrda-laOMIJRWtfghmTzWZfAjH6gishP)\n[2] [masterplumberacademy.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHO-WmP1c1Q9LlATmt5f4WV2Jcr6H9aXD8jNIBca69KKv-HiOwuiu6yX6tRfo4K91cYAmzC0UX069uuh-YO64dHr56evh5XnjGtcjsvLX6x-pOF6R6E1nJozhq_WFpVyvz6)\n[3] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFBcKbwkrBb5Mg4r6yRXWfG_mpcfNX0rL7eiN15z3tukwaHAda6PYlYukyUxLokyP4dsqEJ3VvsAHARI9cn63fp9VmYhVK8MEJG2yL09zkzrIsUN65tMEM2KaRqgfCC1CliVJQqHlE=)\n[4] [scribd.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH40sGS5NVVfapn3PoEysH4yuA7YS-u8ocd1xRKMXQNzA9tOHqffgB_3HT3TSzQCrqd8NXtG4Wb_oNwmc7tI5fJfxP77aiyYYjOvkJi91CZ5GzpAFWe59nug3Lc9Lpp-P3W0ja7avZzB8CxG7DXAcmphiXIm2O-CmxCliKfWDn4gJPrznS4xP8yRCZxA-szocmNbTw7b6Y=)\n[5] [scribd.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGchgc1swelqgieLgni2Et_hnTYnvln0sxh_IfSfIkNlF_7WCEV3oO12eCUND4YKUJaIGjbix6PCfP12ArsNKYouncP1IKavxav1R3iS3peALIno_3kF_hYIEFr31dzOT2IiLe2QiMNX-gSQzWWaM8Zh07K)\n[6] [masterplumberacademy.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGk38lLVeV8GULNDzPeHY0Ii5acWIanC72JxJvIewurTc3Wh4G0DBYyUvgKnrMecKZfa5XWC9OTaQt3x2PGFltkmSyJTAm7MALUK_izcEANTCXTOKdXuYawQFlvuH66Hc44USFqke23jemvnlZHe-ScpNotgGfkh0a0jMqcCHnrQY11lN9Zl2-8Qw==)\n[7] [scribd.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEWF9RdqGUs7IY1IM8WHSQ_J0Igkf6ARIyeiZpe-S6UO5OlCRHibelss5xfmGWWXeUIV9Ky08Ox3VxprGCmFERaQ0DBY1Al8RmsVKtJT34wZU_5SlJRozhIo2lTawifgmfo2SPLWp4vwrdXKzlV5hY-XfGHwYZxlfsYY6yZeNENImGXxR_jkTLg4sQ=)\n[8] [abebooks.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG-z61ANvvll0i9bHn006KJaum470EQJnbaE1nhrkuX0e6RCHTkRyufW2ajLSHLv6svwtucCqBUZ71GqGeDthVwlSVc4Q6pLCH3mTmdS7Lay5kbwUG-xqyaMKJbbQUjYd5qOsOIC1KVZ7QJQ32_-yBZTO4yVti0xSnXXGZJwSuV7tQUqxuMt0luc2sQISZbgtQ2AYQ=)\n[9] [jobtestprep.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHIyfS5Mr3SejH_p4zsF1BdF2F6nx-ihYd619-eumo-CoQ_7v