be adding an indicator to the graphic with a question mark.\n\n\n**Updating Question Entries**\n\nI\'m now focusing on cleanly replacing the final questions in `src/questions.js`. I am updating questions 74 through 76, ensuring the accuracy of the question text, answer choices, and correct answers.\n\n\n"
